contentText:
Beastie Boys bandmates Mike D and Ad-Rock made a rare joint appearance on The Daily Show on Monday night (Nov. 16) to talk about the origins of the beloved hip-hop trio and the 40th anniversary of their landmark breakthrough 1986 Def Jam Records debut, License to Ill .

